e general meeting of the Members holding the issued Shares of that class.","section":"","block":216,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-042570","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-09-14","reportDate":"2026-09-14","cik":"0002011458","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2011458/000149315226042570/ex99-2.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/7f22498f5fca6d7608c6ba5f7d90f00aed1375fc2fb81c17ca3a0dc3424de8c4.bin","sha256":"7f22498f5fca6d7608c6ba5f7d90f00aed1375fc2fb81c17ca3a0dc3424de8c4"}},{"id":"e3769dee82ac71b85b9a65bae9c0de81a5fee87bbdb1eeac1cea6220a05f209d","quote":"(b)a Treasury Share shall not be voted, directly or indirectly, at any meeting of the Company and shall not be counted in determining the total number of issued shares at any given time, whether for the purposes of these Articles or the Act.","context":"(a)the Company shall not be treated as a Member for any purpose and shall not exercise any right in respect of the Treasury Shares, and any purported exercise of such a right shall be void; and","section":"","block":231,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-042570","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-09-14","reportDate":"2026-09-14","cik":"0002011458","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2011458/000149315226042570/ex99-2.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/7f22498f5fca6d7608c6ba5f7d90f00aed1375fc2fb81c17ca3a0dc3424de8c4.bin","sha256":"7f22498f5fca6d7608c6ba5f7d90f00aed1375fc2fb81c17ca3a0dc3424de8c4"}},{"id":"cdc791c5f11757671d39e1e9e708e3801ef4430706cfa06ab71c23a9b4f3dda0","quote":"6.2The transferor shall be deemed to remain the holder of a Share until the name of the transferee is entered into the Register of Members.","context":"19","section":"","block":343,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified"