,"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2011458/000149315226042570/ex99-2.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/7f22498f5fca6d7608c6ba5f7d90f00aed1375fc2fb81c17ca3a0dc3424de8c4.bin","sha256":"7f22498f5fca6d7608c6ba5f7d90f00aed1375fc2fb81c17ca3a0dc3424de8c4"}},{"id":"e4b0c17d5888f4f092319208d830a1162d82a294fd05ecb59478f5c2a9f9783b","quote":"11.3The chairman of a general meeting (including any Virtual Meeting) shall be the chairman of the Board or such other Director as the Directors may determine. Absent any such person being present at the meeting within fifteen minutes of the time appointed for the meeting, the Directors present shall elect one of their number to chair the meeting. The chairman of the meeting shall be entitled to attend and participate at any such general meeting by means of Electronic Communication Facilities, and to act as the chairman of such general meeting, in which event the chairman of the meeting shall be deemed to be present at the meeting.","context":"Chairman","section":"","block":473,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-042570","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-09-14","reportDate":"2026-09-14","cik":"0002011458","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2011458/000149315226042570/ex99-2.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/7f22498f5fca6d7608c6ba5f7d90f00aed1375fc2fb81c17ca3a0dc3424de8c4.bin","sha256":"7f22498f5fca6d7608c6ba5f7d90f00aed1375fc2fb81c17ca3a0dc3424de8c4"}},{"id":"636936e8b46a585493683072a0cc693d59a1c135f0373dc117d991659447e9a7","quote":"11.4If no Director is present within fifteen minutes of the time appointed for the meeting, or if no Director is willing to act as chairman, the Members present in person or by proxy and entitled to vote shall choose one of their number to chair the meeting.","context":"11.3The chairman of a general meeting (including any Virtual Meeting) shall be the chairman of the Board or such other Director as the Di