ing at which the person named in the form of appointment of proxy proposes to vote. They must be delivered in either of the following ways:","context":"How and when proxy is to be delivered","section":"","block":555,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-042570","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-09-14","reportDate":"2026-09-14","cik":"0002011458","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2011458/000149315226042570/ex99-2.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/7f22498f5fca6d7608c6ba5f7d90f00aed1375fc2fb81c17ca3a0dc3424de8c4.bin","sha256":"7f22498f5fca6d7608c6ba5f7d90f00aed1375fc2fb81c17ca3a0dc3424de8c4"}},{"id":"9ca7ee96f038c4d15a5a1eaa6debde7c3a2039f002ba724e02efc9de7b70c661","quote":"14.1 The first Directors shall be appointed in writing by the subscriber or subscribers to the Memorandum, or a majority of them.","context":"First Directors","section":"","block":575,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-042570","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-09-14","reportDate":"2026-09-14","cik":"0002011458","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2011458/000149315226042570/ex99-2.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/7f22498f5fca6d7608c6ba5f7d90f00aed1375fc2fb81c17ca3a0dc3424de8c4.bin","sha256":"7f22498f5fca6d7608c6ba5f7d90f00aed1375fc2fb81c17ca3a0dc3424de8c4"}},{"id":"1476eb1d7b762039ad1291c6218319f89d2767b25a1b653535aa9bc16b31fdeb","quote":"14.5 A Director may be appointed by Ordinary Resolution or by the Directors. Any appointment may be to fill a vacancy or as an additional Director.","context":"Appointment of Directors","section":"","block":584,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001493152-26-042570","form":"6-K","filedAt":"2026-09-14","reportDate":"2026-09-14","cik":"0002011458","url":"https://ww